WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.425
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.695 --> 00:15.725
(Jung Yong Hwa)

3
00:16.025 --> 00:18.365
(Hong Seung Hee)

4
00:19.035 --> 00:22.265
(Lee Yi Kyung)

5
00:23.375 --> 00:25.235
(Park Yu Na)

6
00:36.655 --> 00:40.255
(Oh! My Guard)

7
00:40.255 --> 00:41.255
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

8
00:41.255 --> 00:42.995
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

9
00:44.355 --> 00:46.025
So pull yourself together and listen.

10
00:47.065 --> 00:48.225
You are not Cha Hong Du.

11
00:56.335 --> 00:59.035
Your name and the world you believe in.

12
01:01.345 --> 01:02.475
None of it is real.

13
01:08.245 --> 01:10.485
No, what on earth are you...

14
01:16.395 --> 01:18.895
- What is wrong? - My head hurts so much.

15
01:20.695 --> 01:23.065
Tell me again so I can understand. What is not real?

16
01:24.665 --> 01:26.565
Some patients forget reality and...

17
01:27.205 --> 01:29.575
hope to live in a world of their own making.

18
01:29.905 --> 01:31.905
If you are like Mr. Choi...

19
01:33.975 --> 01:35.445
I am asking what you mean by that.

20
01:40.315 --> 01:41.315
Hong Du.

21
01:41.585 --> 01:42.785
Tae Bong.

22
01:47.985 --> 01:50.995
It is still cold at night. Hey, call him again.

23
01:51.325 --> 01:52.325
Yes, okay.

24
01:53.925 --> 01:57.135
He is not in the parking lot either. This guy is really driving me crazy.

25
01:58.895 --> 02:00.135
Na Ri, where are you...

26
02:00.805 --> 02:03.135
What? Are you all together right now?

27
02:04.205 --> 02:06.705
Okay, I will be right in. Tell him to stop calling me.

28
02:06.775 --> 02:07.775
Seriously.

29
02:08.505 --> 02:10.075
I guess everyone is worried about us.

30
02:10.815 --> 02:11.975
Anyway, it is a relief.

31
02:12.515 --> 02:14.215
I was worried you two might have gotten lost.

32
02:15.515 --> 02:16.585
Have you not heard?

33
02:17.385 --> 02:18.685
The human navigation system?

34
02:19.725 --> 02:21.985
You have heard of it, right? Um Navigation.

35
02:23.355 --> 02:24.695
But why did you two leave your drinks...

36
02:24.825 --> 02:25.825
and come out here?

37
02:27.965 --> 02:28.965
To look for a ring.

38
02:30.695 --> 02:31.695
A ring?

39
02:32.565 --> 02:33.635
What?

40
02:33.635 --> 02:36.475
Oh, yes. I left Um Tae Bong's ring behind.

41
02:38.905 --> 02:41.005
Be careful. You almost fell.

42
02:41.775 --> 02:44.675
- You should be careful yourself. - Hong Du, it is dangerous,

43
02:44.745 --> 02:47.845
so walk on the inside. It is dark, so stay close to me.

44
02:48.445 --> 02:49.445
Okay.

45
02:56.495 --> 02:58.725
Tae Bong, hurry up. I am scared.

46
02:59.155 --> 03:00.225
Okay.

47
03:26.955 --> 03:29.555
Your name and the world you believe in.

48
03:31.995 --> 03:33.095
None of it is real.

49
03:34.165 --> 03:35.165
What was that?

50
03:36.195 --> 03:37.635
What did he mean earlier?

51
03:42.735 --> 03:43.805
Mr. Han?

52
03:59.185 --> 04:02.255
But the mood earlier was a bit...

53
04:03.295 --> 04:05.455
Oh, it is nothing.

54
04:11.195 --> 04:13.365
- But Mr. Han. - Yes?

55
04:13.905 --> 04:15.165
Why are you so nice to me?

56
04:17.205 --> 04:18.205
I do not know either.

57
04:26.685 --> 04:27.685
It is hot.

58
04:47.935 --> 04:48.935
Tae Bong, are you asleep?

59
04:49.035 --> 04:50.975
(Tae Bong, are you asleep?)

60
04:51.135 --> 04:53.875
I have been asleep for a while. You are dead if you wake me up.

61
05:05.215 --> 05:06.525
If you disappear without saying anything again,

62
05:06.585 --> 05:07.725
you are really going to get hit.

63
05:07.785 --> 05:09.285
(Disappear again, and you get hit.)

64
05:13.095 --> 05:14.165
Darn it.

65
05:24.105 --> 05:25.975
- What is it? - Nothing.

66
05:26.775 --> 05:28.405
Su Dong told me to check your schedule...

67
05:28.475 --> 05:29.675
for tomorrow afternoon.

68
05:29.815 --> 05:32.015
I am going to sleep like a log until the charity party.

69
05:32.615 --> 05:33.785
So you are dead if you wake me up.

70
05:35.585 --> 05:36.585
Are you sulking again?

71
05:38.855 --> 05:39.955
Thanks for earlier.

72
05:41.055 --> 05:42.625
For shining the flashlight behind me.

73
05:45.695 --> 05:46.695
You saw that?

74
05:47.165 --> 05:48.365
Of course I did.

75
05:49.265 --> 05:52.065
You were just like my dad. Worried that I might fall,

76
05:52.135 --> 05:55.305
he always shined a flashlight behind me when I was young.

77
05:56.105 --> 05:57.135
He hugged me a lot, too.

78
06:01.145 --> 06:02.775
Are you sure...

79
06:03.745 --> 06:04.745
that it is your memory?

80
06:06.345 --> 06:08.785
Of course I am sure. What kind of question is that?

81
06:09.185 --> 06:10.215
What about other memories?

82
06:11.215 --> 06:13.625
Do you not remember anything else from your childhood?

83
06:22.365 --> 06:25.365
Gosh, this keeps happening lately.

84
06:25.435 --> 06:26.835
Whenever I try to remember something,

85
06:27.005 --> 06:28.705
it feels like my head is going to split open...

86
06:30.205 --> 06:31.675
Is it an aftereffect of the accident?

87
06:38.075 --> 06:39.745
More importantly...

88
06:40.515 --> 06:43.315
About what you said at the beach earlier.

89
06:44.185 --> 06:46.485
You said my name and the world I believe in...

90
06:46.585 --> 06:47.755
are all fake.

91
06:49.285 --> 06:51.495
- What did you mean by that? - That?

92
06:53.565 --> 06:54.565
That...

93
06:54.995 --> 06:56.935
I was just saying that.

94
06:58.235 --> 06:59.235
Just saying it?

95
07:00.105 --> 07:01.935
You have been talking nonsense lately.

96
07:02.465 --> 07:03.975
Dreaming about me dying and all.

97
07:05.175 --> 07:08.175
And lying in a hospital for three years,

98
07:08.245 --> 07:09.705
then suddenly appearing out of nowhere.

99
07:10.115 --> 07:11.415
It all seems like a lie.

100
07:11.475 --> 07:14.245
Your world, the dreams you have, all of it.

101
07:23.085 --> 07:24.695
Is that really it?

102
07:27.825 --> 07:28.825
Seriously?

103
07:29.835 --> 07:31.595
Do you think I am hiding something from you?

104
07:32.665 --> 07:34.335
No, not necessarily that.

105
07:34.965 --> 07:36.265
You just seemed a bit strange earlier.

106
07:36.675 --> 07:37.775
I am always strange.

107
07:38.375 --> 07:41.875
Gosh, what is that? I was serious for nothing.

108
07:42.475 --> 07:43.475
Sleep well.

109
07:44.675 --> 07:45.715
Thanks for earlier.

110
07:49.445 --> 07:50.855
For comforting me.

111
07:52.085 --> 07:53.955
I forgive your sins.

112
07:54.555 --> 07:57.925
Do not feel sorry for kiddo anymore.

113
07:57.995 --> 07:59.795
Because I forgave you on her behalf.

114
08:01.425 --> 08:03.125
But what I need...

115
08:04.235 --> 08:05.335
is not comfort...

116
08:07.005 --> 08:08.005
Treatment, I guess.

117
08:11.105 --> 08:12.105
Go.

118
08:27.355 --> 08:29.555
How can I treat him?

119
08:30.795 --> 08:32.425
Are you sure...

120
08:33.325 --> 08:34.325
that it is your memory?

121
08:37.135 --> 08:39.165
But why did he say that?

122
08:51.915 --> 08:53.215
In that drama,

123
08:53.985 --> 08:56.015
there was no childhood backstory.

124
08:59.985 --> 09:00.985
Could it be?

125
09:17.605 --> 09:18.875
Did you not come out for some fresh air?

126
09:18.935 --> 09:19.945
Song Na Ri.

127
09:37.195 --> 09:38.195
Well...

128
09:39.995 --> 09:41.395
How did you recognize me?

129
09:41.665 --> 09:42.825
People rarely recognize me barefaced.

130
09:42.965 --> 09:44.635
You look exactly the same with or without makeup.

131
09:45.365 --> 09:47.435
I think you can skip the makeup starting tomorrow.

132
09:47.565 --> 09:48.565
You hear that a lot, right?

133
09:48.635 --> 09:50.135
No, that is the first time I have heard that!

134
09:51.475 --> 09:52.475
Unbelievable.

135
09:59.775 --> 10:01.145
Well, anyway...

136
10:01.945 --> 10:02.945
You cannot sleep?

137
10:03.955 --> 10:06.485
- You too, Na Ri? - I asked you first.

138
10:06.825 --> 10:08.285
You can just answer first.

139
10:08.955 --> 10:10.955
We really do not get along.

140
10:15.765 --> 10:16.765
But...

141
10:18.095 --> 10:19.135
For some reason...

142
10:19.695 --> 10:21.505
do you not feel like we are falling behind?

143
10:23.435 --> 10:25.175
I am still going to keep trying, though.

144
10:28.375 --> 10:29.445
I guess you still do not get it.

145
10:32.375 --> 10:33.945
Do you think I am an idiot?

146
10:35.185 --> 10:36.185
You know what?

147
10:36.955 --> 10:38.915
I really do not like you.

148
10:43.285 --> 10:45.955
This is ridiculous. He really thinks I am an idiot.

149
10:48.595 --> 10:49.595
Does she actually know?

150
11:02.705 --> 11:03.845
Song Na Ri!

151
11:04.775 --> 11:05.815
Good night!

152
11:06.275 --> 11:07.285
What the heck!

153
11:08.085 --> 11:09.715
The shop is closed this weekend,

154
11:09.785 --> 11:11.055
so I am going to tag along with Tae Bong.

155
11:11.285 --> 11:13.355
With the commercial shoot and the BK Party event,

156
11:13.425 --> 11:14.585
it will take 2 days and 1 night.

157
11:14.655 --> 11:15.955
On a 2-day-1-night trip.

158
11:16.055 --> 11:18.325
I hope you all take some time to heal like me.

159
11:21.425 --> 11:24.935
(Jin Ah)

160
11:30.205 --> 11:31.205
Jin Ah.

161
11:32.075 --> 11:35.275
You said you got invited to the BK Party, right?

162
12:07.175 --> 12:09.645
Gosh. You scared me.

163
12:12.815 --> 12:13.815
What is it?

164
12:14.315 --> 12:15.515
Is this a zombie wake-up call?

165
12:17.585 --> 12:18.615
What? What is it?

166
12:19.215 --> 12:21.755
- Did I... - You died.

167
12:22.025 --> 12:23.795
You keep dying in my dreams.

168
12:26.625 --> 12:30.025
Well, they say dreams reflect your true feelings.

169
12:30.465 --> 12:33.035
Do you want to kill me? Did you kill me?

170
12:34.135 --> 12:35.465
It did not end with a gun.

171
12:36.435 --> 12:37.505
Then who shot me?

172
12:38.875 --> 12:39.875
Where are you going?

173
12:40.205 --> 12:42.345
To get breakfast. If I do not go now, I will be late.

174
12:42.545 --> 12:43.775
I need to eat at least three plates.

175
12:44.075 --> 12:46.985
You just said I died. How can you eat at a time like this?

176
12:47.445 --> 12:49.615
Should you not at least fast to mourn my death?

177
12:52.355 --> 12:55.825
Is she worried I might die like in the drama?

178
12:56.855 --> 12:59.555
Is that why she keeps having those dreams...

179
13:00.495 --> 13:01.495
What is it?

180
13:01.565 --> 13:03.125
Did Cha Hong Du dream about you dying?

181
13:03.295 --> 13:04.535
Like in your drama?

182
13:05.665 --> 13:06.835
Oh, seriously.

183
13:07.365 --> 13:08.365
What dream?

184
13:09.035 --> 13:10.275
Where are you going?

185
13:10.605 --> 13:12.735
- I am going to get breakfast. - Unbelievable.

186
13:12.805 --> 13:15.345
Are they all possessed by ghosts that died from missing breakfast?

187
13:16.075 --> 13:17.075
Where is Dong Seok?

188
13:17.275 --> 13:18.945
He rushed back to Seoul this morning.

189
13:19.745 --> 13:20.885
- Seoul? - Yes.

190
13:20.885 --> 13:22.685
- Why? - I do not know.

191
13:24.685 --> 13:26.855
I begged a senior officer to get this for me.

192
13:27.725 --> 13:29.225
Could it be the same guy from the parking lot?

193
13:31.795 --> 13:33.055
Tae Bong will know when he sees it.

194
13:41.035 --> 13:42.465
They confirmed the handwriting matches.

195
13:42.905 --> 13:45.105
But are you really not going to request an official investigation?

196
13:47.575 --> 13:52.045
This letter dates back two months.

197
13:52.915 --> 13:54.045
Darn it.

198
14:00.325 --> 14:02.985
Yes, CEO Park, I am currently in front of Tae Bong's house...

199
14:03.525 --> 14:05.425
and the security camera on the wall...

200
14:21.905 --> 14:23.145
I will call you right back.

201
14:36.355 --> 14:37.525
What are you doing, you punk?

202
14:38.795 --> 14:40.295
Who are you to snoop around someone else's house?

203
14:40.325 --> 14:42.495
Why are you doing this? I was just passing by...

204
14:42.565 --> 14:43.565
Hold on.

205
14:43.665 --> 14:45.295
You snooped around without knowing whose house it is?

206
14:46.465 --> 14:48.905
I know. I know it is Um Tae Bong's house.

207
14:49.335 --> 14:50.335
Was it you?

208
14:50.675 --> 14:52.075
The one who has been hanging around Tae Bong...

209
14:52.535 --> 14:56.275
Yes, that is correct. Please check my pocket.

210
14:56.475 --> 14:57.475
Here.

211
15:00.615 --> 15:01.745
(Our Tree Foundation)

212
15:03.045 --> 15:04.055
(Our Tree Foundation)

213
15:04.815 --> 15:09.025
Well, earlier this year, Um Tae Bong made a donation to our organization,

214
15:09.085 --> 15:12.155
so I came to thank him. It is the truth.

215
15:20.505 --> 15:21.505
I am sorry.

216
15:22.165 --> 15:23.975
I misunderstood the situation.

217
15:24.835 --> 15:26.275
I should have contacted you before coming...

218
15:26.835 --> 15:27.845
Here.

219
15:31.445 --> 15:35.045
- I will come back next time. - Yes, I am sorry.

220
15:36.345 --> 15:37.355
I am sorry.

221
15:51.795 --> 15:52.835
Yes, CEO Park.

222
15:54.765 --> 15:56.235
No, I just had a little misunderstanding.

223
15:58.935 --> 16:01.645
And about Hong Du guarding Tae Bong,

224
16:02.605 --> 16:04.045
everyone has found out about it.

225
16:16.455 --> 16:18.555
Are you okay? Is everything fine?

226
16:18.725 --> 16:19.995
What about the man who just came in?

227
16:20.325 --> 16:21.725
(Cleaning Supplies)

228
16:40.785 --> 16:42.345
That girl was a bodyguard?

229
16:44.985 --> 16:46.355
This is going to be fun.

230
16:51.225 --> 16:54.065
(Our Tree Foundation)

231
17:12.575 --> 17:14.185
(Our Tree Foundation)

232
17:14.585 --> 17:16.645
- We're from Our Tree Foundation. - Excuse me.

233
17:17.755 --> 17:18.755
Excuse me.

234
17:18.815 --> 17:20.115
Hello, we are from Our Tree Foundation.

235
17:25.025 --> 17:26.125
Excuse me.

236
17:42.445 --> 17:43.705
Did you eat a lot, even dessert?

237
17:44.445 --> 17:47.285
I would be full if I ate that too. If I am full, I will get sleepy,

238
17:47.485 --> 17:48.515
and if I am sleepy, I will sleep.

239
17:48.585 --> 17:50.655
If I sleep, I will have that dream again.

240
17:51.385 --> 17:52.615
Are you scared...

241
17:53.985 --> 17:55.985
- that I might die? - Do you think I would be excited?

242
17:59.255 --> 18:00.325
Why?

243
18:00.695 --> 18:01.725
In that dream,

244
18:03.165 --> 18:05.635
- did you cry? - Do you think I laughed?

245
18:06.635 --> 18:08.635
Well, do not worry. They say dreams are the opposite of reality.

246
18:08.765 --> 18:11.835
You are going to live until you are old and gray.

247
18:13.375 --> 18:14.375
I am leaving.

248
18:17.275 --> 18:18.875
Am I worried about that right now?

249
18:19.675 --> 18:21.885
Anyway, this is all because of the writer.

250
18:22.015 --> 18:23.345
Just because I refused the kiss scene,

251
18:23.415 --> 18:24.685
she kills off the main character at the end?

252
18:24.755 --> 18:25.755
And with a gun?

253
18:26.315 --> 18:29.325
Since when does Korea even allow firearms?

254
18:37.495 --> 18:40.535
We have time before the event, right?

255
18:55.315 --> 18:56.785
But why a survival game all of a sudden?

256
18:57.115 --> 18:58.815
Just bored.

257
18:58.885 --> 19:00.355
Since we are wearing the same outfit,

258
19:00.415 --> 19:02.385
I guess we have no choice but to team up.

259
19:02.925 --> 19:03.925
The rules are simple.

260
19:03.995 --> 19:05.255
Minimum shooting distance is 1m.

261
19:05.325 --> 19:07.195
No headshots and no hitting below the belt.

262
19:07.295 --> 19:10.065
- Got it? - Okay, 1 shot, 1 kill.

263
19:10.565 --> 19:14.965
All right, we start in five seconds. Ready?

264
19:16.135 --> 19:17.135
Five.

265
19:18.205 --> 19:19.205
Four.

266
19:20.235 --> 19:21.245
Three!

267
19:21.945 --> 19:24.375
- What is he... - So cool.

268
19:24.845 --> 19:25.915
Hong Du, good luck.

269
19:26.375 --> 19:27.385
Good luck.

270
20:01.485 --> 20:03.115
Hong Du, you take that side. I will take this side.

271
20:03.185 --> 20:04.185
Go.

272
20:30.575 --> 20:31.575
Where are they?

273
20:53.765 --> 20:54.765
Cha Hong Du?

274
20:57.265 --> 20:58.275
Cha Hong Du.

275
21:00.705 --> 21:01.775
Han Jung Woo.

276
21:37.275 --> 21:38.315
Han Jung Woo.

277
21:52.255 --> 21:55.495
Get up. Han Jung Woo.

278
22:06.575 --> 22:07.605
Cha Hong Du.

279
22:08.705 --> 22:09.705
Watch closely.

280
22:11.615 --> 22:12.975
I am going to change...

281
22:13.975 --> 22:15.685
the last scene you remember.

282
22:31.635 --> 22:32.665
So...

283
22:36.105 --> 22:37.235
From now on...

284
22:41.575 --> 22:43.645
- No more bad dreams... - Um Tae Bong.

285
23:03.425 --> 23:05.795
I will kill you.

286
23:06.865 --> 23:09.105
Darn it. You think this is funny?

287
23:11.575 --> 23:13.875
If you have any last words, say them now.

288
23:14.875 --> 23:15.875
Now...

289
23:17.405 --> 23:18.415
Seriously...

290
23:20.075 --> 23:21.985
From now on,

291
23:22.715 --> 23:24.115
no more bad dreams.

292
23:25.555 --> 23:26.555
Cha Hong Du.

293
23:33.925 --> 23:35.425
Tae Bong!

294
23:39.235 --> 23:42.365
Tae Bong, if you die like this, what am I supposed to do?

295
23:42.435 --> 23:45.705
- Tae Bong, come back to life! - Hey.

296
23:46.275 --> 23:47.275
What?

297
23:48.005 --> 23:49.245
That is not how it goes.

298
23:49.575 --> 23:50.915
Fine, I will avenge you.

299
23:51.515 --> 23:53.575
You are all dead!

300
23:56.615 --> 23:57.685
Stop it, darn it.

301
24:01.455 --> 24:02.555
Na Ri wins.

302
24:03.585 --> 24:06.095
(Na Ri Win)

303
24:10.525 --> 24:11.565
What the?

304
24:22.445 --> 24:23.505
How much would it take?

305
24:24.915 --> 24:25.915
For what?

306
24:30.815 --> 24:31.885
Your price.

307
24:34.085 --> 24:35.355
I want to recruit you.

308
24:36.525 --> 24:37.555
Three thousand dollars a month.

309
24:40.625 --> 24:41.625
You do like money.

310
24:42.395 --> 24:43.395
Five thousand dollars a month?

311
24:50.805 --> 24:51.805
How about...

312
24:52.035 --> 24:53.305
seven thousand?

313
24:56.345 --> 24:59.275
Darn it, my dream of owning a building gets even further away.

314
25:00.615 --> 25:02.015
Talking to yourself again?

315
25:03.045 --> 25:05.355
Anyway, think about being my bodyguard.

316
25:05.885 --> 25:07.685
Honestly, I am in more danger than he is.

317
25:07.755 --> 25:08.755
You saw it last time.

318
25:08.825 --> 25:10.225
I mean, the older male fans at my concerts...

319
25:10.285 --> 25:13.595
- can get pretty wild. - No, don't.

320
25:14.625 --> 25:16.325
Even for fans, that is crossing the line.

321
25:19.295 --> 25:20.565
What you need is...

322
25:20.965 --> 25:22.835
someone to tell you this, not a bodyguard.

323
25:30.075 --> 25:31.075
She is so cool.

324
25:32.375 --> 25:33.375
Thank you.

325
25:34.145 --> 25:36.285
I am in Building A, and you are in Building B.

326
25:36.845 --> 25:39.485
- Let us unpack and meet up later. - Yes, okay.

327
25:48.095 --> 25:51.135
I am closer to you right now than you might think.

328
26:09.515 --> 26:10.985
Gosh, my nose is running.

329
26:14.215 --> 26:16.225
Still as rude as ever, seriously.

330
26:20.255 --> 26:22.265
Oh, it is the pretty lady.

331
26:24.835 --> 26:25.935
Hello.

332
26:26.195 --> 26:27.365
Oh, Hong Du.

333
26:41.745 --> 26:44.915
I am closer to you right now than you might think.

334
26:46.055 --> 26:47.185
Did she come here?

335
26:54.625 --> 26:58.135
- Are you here for the party too? - Yes, with an older female friend.

336
27:01.435 --> 27:03.335
Actually, there is something I want to check.

337
27:07.075 --> 27:08.075
What is going on?

338
27:10.405 --> 27:13.115
Excuse me. The elevator has stopped.

339
27:13.175 --> 27:15.015
I am so sorry, we will fix it as soon as...

340
27:15.185 --> 27:16.245
Excuse me, how long will it take?

341
27:16.315 --> 27:17.915
We will have it fixed within 20 minutes.

342
27:17.985 --> 27:18.985
Twenty minutes?

343
27:21.185 --> 27:22.525
My legs hurt.

344
27:23.885 --> 27:25.995
Let us sit and wait.

345
27:34.505 --> 27:36.405
They say it is bad for women to sit on cold floors.

346
27:37.465 --> 27:39.875
Oh, right.

347
27:42.575 --> 27:43.905
- Thank you. - You are welcome.

348
27:55.885 --> 27:59.425
Hyun Joo is like a splinter stuck under my fingernail.

349
28:01.895 --> 28:03.065
Must be nice to be a splinter.

350
28:04.195 --> 28:06.395
- What? - What?

351
28:09.865 --> 28:13.035
Well, if a man...

352
28:13.275 --> 28:16.405
calls a woman a splinter stuck under his fingernail,

353
28:16.805 --> 28:18.145
that means he really likes her, right?

354
28:19.345 --> 28:20.415
A man...

355
28:21.585 --> 28:22.745
said that about a woman?

356
28:23.545 --> 28:24.555
Yes.

357
28:24.855 --> 28:26.655
I thought about it after hearing that.

358
28:27.315 --> 28:30.655
That man must really like that splinter.

359
28:32.095 --> 28:33.095
I doubt it.

360
28:35.865 --> 28:38.495
The splinter probably fell out a long time ago,

361
28:38.965 --> 28:40.695
but it has been so long that he is the only one...

362
28:40.835 --> 28:41.835
who does not realize it.

363
28:42.505 --> 28:43.665
That is how it sounds to me.

364
28:45.975 --> 28:47.805
That is just how time spent together works.

365
28:48.645 --> 28:49.905
It makes people very confused.

366
28:51.345 --> 28:54.175
I know because I have been through that kind of experience myself.

367
28:55.385 --> 28:56.385
Experience?

368
28:56.685 --> 28:57.685
Yes.

369
28:58.755 --> 29:00.355
I am finally more certain now...

370
29:01.585 --> 29:02.585
about how I feel.

371
29:08.265 --> 29:11.435
Then what if a man is always...

372
29:11.495 --> 29:13.635
getting mad and yelling at a woman?

373
29:13.965 --> 29:16.465
- He likes her. - What? No.

374
29:17.065 --> 29:18.075
I bet he does.

375
29:19.375 --> 29:20.775
I know a guy like that too.

376
29:20.975 --> 29:22.475
He nags me more than a boyfriend would.

377
29:23.245 --> 29:27.345
I mean, even though I am older, he always just calls me Hyun Joo.

378
29:28.545 --> 29:29.885
But he has not been doing that lately.

379
29:34.185 --> 29:35.325
It is frustrating.

380
29:36.525 --> 29:37.855
Hold on a second.

381
29:38.555 --> 29:41.195
Whenever I got in a car, I could not breathe,

382
29:41.965 --> 29:44.365
but ever since I got this, I have been able to ride in them.

383
29:44.795 --> 29:46.335
It is a super effective motion sickness patch.

384
29:46.865 --> 29:49.865
If you take this, you will be able to endure it.

385
29:50.865 --> 29:51.875
This?

386
29:53.535 --> 29:54.545
What is it?

387
29:59.315 --> 30:02.715
Tears are welling up so I lift my head

388
30:03.115 --> 30:06.455
And smile a little more so they do not fall

389
30:06.815 --> 30:10.025
Why are you doing this to me? What are you saying?

390
30:10.355 --> 30:13.855
All the words you said today up to the sky

391
30:14.225 --> 30:17.765
The words I could never say

392
30:34.545 --> 30:35.815
Secretary Kim, what brings you here?

393
30:38.915 --> 30:39.915
What is it?

394
30:40.185 --> 30:43.685
The chairman will also be attending the VVIP private party.

395
30:55.835 --> 30:57.365
Doctor,

396
30:57.805 --> 30:59.805
you are going through a lot of trouble because of me.

397
31:00.405 --> 31:01.805
You are in good condition today.

398
31:03.945 --> 31:06.175
Um Tae Bong must have taken good care of you.

399
31:10.345 --> 31:12.615
I wonder how many more days like this I will have...

400
31:13.685 --> 31:14.925
I feel like I am just...

401
31:15.725 --> 31:17.555
making everyone else suffer for nothing.

402
31:18.755 --> 31:22.125
Now, I think it would be best to consider a specialized facility...

403
31:22.325 --> 31:24.395
where he can receive both medication and physical therapy.

404
31:24.995 --> 31:27.065
Yes, well,

405
31:27.365 --> 31:29.705
that is something we need to discuss as well.

406
31:29.965 --> 31:31.605
Excuse me. I have a phone call...

407
31:33.175 --> 31:34.235
Yes, hello.

408
31:34.505 --> 31:36.775
Did that person also go to the BK event?

409
31:37.545 --> 31:40.645
I told you about that before, but why do you ask?

410
31:48.025 --> 31:51.795
It seems the young lady was indeed staying in that neighborhood.

411
31:52.225 --> 31:53.995
It looks like they sneaked the young lady away...

412
31:54.095 --> 31:55.165
before you arrived, Chairman Oh.

413
31:55.725 --> 31:56.925
Could the money from selling the shares...

414
31:56.995 --> 31:58.495
be her escape fund?

415
31:58.865 --> 32:01.735
But earlier, when we were leaving your house,

416
32:01.935 --> 32:03.465
Manager Nam Goong was also moving in a hurry...

417
32:18.615 --> 32:20.355
(Elevator Under Maintenance, Do Not Board)

418
32:24.425 --> 32:26.255
She is a woman who absolutely cannot stand feeling trapped.

419
32:26.795 --> 32:27.925
Is there enough air in there?

420
32:28.265 --> 32:29.825
How many hours are you going to keep her locked up?

421
32:29.895 --> 32:31.595
It has only been ten minutes.

422
32:31.895 --> 32:33.095
Please hurry up.

423
32:39.605 --> 32:40.605
Tae Bong.

424
32:41.545 --> 32:42.545
Are you two okay?

425
32:43.175 --> 32:44.245
What kind of person are you?

426
32:44.745 --> 32:46.945
You are really driving me crazy...

427
32:48.215 --> 32:49.215
What did you do in there?

428
32:49.285 --> 32:51.145
What did you touch to make the elevator stop?

429
32:51.215 --> 32:54.685
Gosh. Now it is my fault that the elevator broke down?

430
32:56.585 --> 32:57.855
What are you staring at?

431
33:00.155 --> 33:01.295
Hong Du, you must have been so scared.

432
33:01.365 --> 33:04.065
Regardless, it is our fault. We apologize.

433
33:10.905 --> 33:11.905
Tae Bong.

434
33:13.705 --> 33:16.675
Right. Are you okay, too?

435
33:17.675 --> 33:18.675
Yes.

436
33:19.045 --> 33:20.045
That is a relief.

437
33:20.975 --> 33:21.985
This will not do.

438
33:22.245 --> 33:25.185
You only cause trouble wandering around, so stay in your room later.

439
33:25.355 --> 33:27.015
What? Then what about the party?

440
33:27.085 --> 33:29.425
It is a VVIP-only party, do you think they will not have bodyguards?

441
33:29.625 --> 33:30.625
You do not have to come later.

442
33:31.525 --> 33:33.595
Fine, I will not go. I would not go even if you begged me.

443
33:33.655 --> 33:36.525
I did not have anything to wear anyway, happy?

444
33:37.265 --> 33:38.265
Darn it.

445
33:40.835 --> 33:41.835
Let us go.

446
34:02.055 --> 34:03.185
You can go by yourself, right?

447
34:04.055 --> 34:05.095
What?

448
34:05.095 --> 34:06.225
I need to get some fresh air.

449
34:08.495 --> 34:09.495
Okay.

450
34:10.095 --> 34:11.095
See you later.

451
34:21.945 --> 34:22.945
Darn it.

452
34:26.145 --> 34:28.885
Come on, is it my fault the elevator broke down?

453
34:28.985 --> 34:30.345
He will not even let me go to the party.

454
34:30.785 --> 34:32.485
And yelling at me in front of her.

455
34:33.315 --> 34:35.855
He is just a terrible person, seriously.

456
34:44.395 --> 34:46.795
Hong Du, as a way to comfort a client,

457
34:47.195 --> 34:49.105
I prepared a small gift.

458
35:49.295 --> 35:50.795
Hong Du, are you feeling a bit better now?

459
35:51.865 --> 35:54.235
I went through a lot of trouble to get this bicycle here.

460
35:55.565 --> 35:56.935
Yes, thanks to you.

461
35:58.165 --> 35:59.175
Thank you, Jung Woo.

462
36:01.845 --> 36:05.745
If only a certain someone was even half as nice as you.

463
36:08.385 --> 36:09.745
But it is really cool.

464
36:10.985 --> 36:12.515
Protecting someone like that.

465
36:14.885 --> 36:17.785
I guess I have finally become a useful person now.

466
36:19.125 --> 36:21.825
Why? Did someone say you are useless, Hong Du?

467
36:22.595 --> 36:23.595
Excuse me?

468
36:25.135 --> 36:27.495
No. It is just...

469
36:29.535 --> 36:31.605
I felt like I was not helping anyone...

470
36:32.735 --> 36:35.345
and that nobody liked me.

471
36:37.645 --> 36:38.945
You are the only one who does not know.

472
36:39.845 --> 36:41.585
Hong Du, to many people,

473
36:41.645 --> 36:43.085
you are already someone they cannot live without.

474
36:44.685 --> 36:46.285
- I am? - Yes.

475
36:50.385 --> 36:53.195
Let us bet on who can...

476
36:53.795 --> 36:55.125
get over there first.

477
36:55.495 --> 36:56.725
Where do you mean?

478
36:57.565 --> 36:58.895
- Until where? - That house over there.

479
37:00.365 --> 37:02.905
A bet? What kind of bet?

480
37:11.175 --> 37:13.575
I will catch you, seriously.

481
37:15.315 --> 37:16.315
I will catch you.

482
37:18.085 --> 37:19.615
Did you see him get angry earlier?

483
37:20.215 --> 37:23.755
He has already fallen head over heels for that girl.

484
37:23.855 --> 37:26.125
The problem is that he is the only one who does not know.

485
37:28.055 --> 37:30.825
It is only a matter of time before Toxic Na Ri finds out,

486
37:30.995 --> 37:32.935
and there will be a bloodbath soon.

487
37:33.835 --> 37:34.935
Probably.

488
37:41.335 --> 37:42.605
Your sides are going to be a bit tight.

489
37:43.105 --> 37:44.505
No more carbohydrates from now on.

490
37:45.715 --> 37:46.715
Understood.

491
37:49.085 --> 37:50.485
Your face is tanned too.

492
37:51.485 --> 37:52.955
No more outdoor activities from now on.

493
37:53.315 --> 37:54.355
Understood.

494
37:55.785 --> 37:57.385
It only exhausts the people around you.

495
37:57.455 --> 37:58.755
No more unrequited love from now on.

496
37:58.855 --> 37:59.855
Fine, I get it...

497
38:04.065 --> 38:05.065
What?

498
38:06.595 --> 38:08.935
Actually, I used to be your obsessive fangirl.

499
38:09.335 --> 38:10.835
Because of your policy of never hiring...

500
38:10.905 --> 38:13.275
an obsessive fangirl, I could not tell you until now.

501
38:15.245 --> 38:17.645
That means when it comes to you, there is nothing I do not know.

502
38:18.845 --> 38:21.275
Unrequited love?

503
38:21.275 --> 38:22.415
It is not like that.

504
38:22.485 --> 38:23.685
It really is not.

505
38:24.315 --> 38:25.855
Whatever you say.

506
38:26.815 --> 38:27.855
But...

507
38:27.955 --> 38:29.825
she said it was her first time going to a party,

508
38:29.925 --> 38:31.555
and she was smiling from ear to ear.

509
38:33.855 --> 38:34.925
So what do you want me to do?

510
38:39.395 --> 38:40.865
Could you do me...

511
38:42.335 --> 38:43.565
a favor?

512
38:52.345 --> 38:53.345
Hello.

513
38:53.515 --> 38:55.445
By any chance, did you see that woman?

514
38:55.515 --> 38:56.785
The ugly one who looks like she has a temper,

515
38:56.845 --> 38:57.845
- my type... - Oh, right.

516
39:00.115 --> 39:01.855
You mean the secret bodyguard?

517
39:04.555 --> 39:05.755
Everyone knows.

518
39:05.825 --> 39:08.155
I saw her leave with Director Han earlier.

519
39:08.225 --> 39:10.065
If it is urgent, I can call...

520
39:12.835 --> 39:14.865
That arrogant jerk.

521
39:15.365 --> 39:16.365
Darn it.

522
39:24.875 --> 39:26.375
I actually confirmed it.

523
39:26.745 --> 39:27.945
What kind of person are you?

524
39:28.245 --> 39:30.545
You are really driving me crazy...

525
39:31.345 --> 39:32.355
But...

526
39:35.785 --> 39:37.285
It was not Song Na Ri.

527
39:38.755 --> 39:39.955
It was that girl?

528
40:11.925 --> 40:13.225
Thank you for letting me use your phone.

529
40:23.705 --> 40:25.135
Back then, with Um Tae Bong,

530
40:25.205 --> 40:27.005
I received a tip that it was a contract relationship.

531
40:29.175 --> 40:30.405
And here I thought...

532
40:30.845 --> 40:32.745
you were going to write a nice article about my marriage,

533
40:32.815 --> 40:33.875
which is why I came out here.

534
40:34.475 --> 40:35.485
I am sorry.

535
40:35.815 --> 40:38.485
But not writing the marriage article and letting this pass quietly...

536
40:38.555 --> 40:39.755
is actually helping you, is it not?

537
40:40.055 --> 40:43.055
That gold digger suspicion from last time...

538
40:43.725 --> 40:45.025
will just cause another uproar, right?

539
40:47.795 --> 40:49.365
You really will not write the marriage article, right?

540
40:49.425 --> 40:52.535
Of course not. You know I have always liked you.

541
40:54.935 --> 40:57.005
The female celebrities who had contract relationships like me...

542
40:57.065 --> 40:58.465
must have all felt the same.

543
40:59.075 --> 41:01.635
"Let's really get Um Tae Bong into bed."

544
41:02.645 --> 41:03.645
But...

545
41:04.575 --> 41:06.945
he was someone who could not handle any physical affection.

546
41:07.415 --> 41:10.045
I only tried it once myself.

547
41:15.955 --> 41:18.155
Thank you for the touching words and comfort.

548
41:20.825 --> 41:22.925
I left the real gift in front of your door.

549
41:24.265 --> 41:26.365
Put it on and come to the party later.

550
41:27.335 --> 41:30.035
Um Tae Bong told me not to come. I am not going.

551
41:32.575 --> 41:35.175
Still, since it is my gift, you should try it on.

552
41:35.575 --> 41:36.705
Hong Du.

553
41:36.775 --> 41:38.175
Do you happen to like the color blue?

554
41:39.045 --> 41:41.375
Yes. I like sky blue, ocean blue,

555
41:41.445 --> 41:43.485
I just like all shades of blue. It is my favorite.

556
41:45.555 --> 41:46.655
Okay, that is a relief.

557
41:47.715 --> 41:48.725
I mean...

558
41:48.785 --> 41:50.855
- I will see you in a bit. - Excuse me?

559
42:13.175 --> 42:14.175
Delivery.

560
42:15.445 --> 42:17.345
(To Customer Song Na Ri)

561
42:22.455 --> 42:24.925
- I will take that for Song Na Ri. - Just a moment, Director Han.

562
42:24.985 --> 42:27.225
- There is one more here. - Thank you.

563
42:28.725 --> 42:29.925
That is a lot of stuff.

564
42:32.935 --> 42:34.935
This one is way too revealing.

565
42:41.835 --> 42:43.305
This one is too flashy, though.

566
42:44.105 --> 42:45.945
Well, my face makes up for it.

567
42:49.785 --> 42:50.785
Who is it?

568
42:52.515 --> 42:53.515
You scared me.

569
42:54.115 --> 42:55.115
What is it?

570
43:02.125 --> 43:03.165
Just put them over there.

571
43:03.495 --> 43:04.495
Sure.

572
43:05.395 --> 43:06.435
Hey.

573
43:06.865 --> 43:07.865
Yes?

574
43:09.665 --> 43:11.935
Here. Which one looks better?

575
43:18.845 --> 43:20.475
I vote for the black dress.

576
43:21.745 --> 43:22.815
Did I not mention it?

577
43:23.415 --> 43:24.945
I majored in design.

578
43:26.385 --> 43:27.715
Na Ri, do you want the outfit to stand out,

579
43:27.785 --> 43:29.955
or do you want your face to stand out?

580
43:32.125 --> 43:33.125
My heart?

581
43:33.455 --> 43:35.925
- Your heart... - At first it was my face,

582
43:36.365 --> 43:39.195
but now it is something else. I want someone to really see me.

583
43:44.365 --> 43:45.375
Why do you ask?

584
43:45.775 --> 43:46.775
That is strange.

585
43:47.805 --> 43:51.805
From the first time I saw you, your face was never what stood out.

586
43:53.045 --> 43:55.215
Look who is talking, seriously.

587
43:57.515 --> 44:00.285
Are you not leaving? I need to change.

588
44:00.815 --> 44:02.225
I voted for the black dress.

589
44:02.285 --> 44:05.455
Too bad. I am wearing the pink one. What a pervert.

590
44:26.915 --> 44:28.115
Are you okay?

591
44:29.485 --> 44:30.485
You are sweating so much...

592
44:30.585 --> 44:31.715
Hold on.

593
44:37.025 --> 44:38.025
Where is Hong Du?

594
44:38.485 --> 44:39.495
Hong Du?

595
44:39.625 --> 44:40.995
You told her never to come to the party,

596
44:41.055 --> 44:42.325
so she is probably in her room.

597
44:42.995 --> 44:44.195
Do not worry.

598
44:44.265 --> 44:46.135
The security team here is doing a great job.

599
44:46.195 --> 44:47.195
Hey, look at me.

600
45:03.315 --> 45:04.745
Oh, Song Na Ri.

601
45:05.285 --> 45:06.515
Writer Pyo!

602
45:08.515 --> 45:10.225
This is a dear younger friend.

603
45:16.425 --> 45:17.465
But hey,

604
45:17.665 --> 45:19.365
you came to keep an eye on Um Tae Bong, did you not?

605
45:19.435 --> 45:20.665
No, I am not keeping an eye on anyone.

606
45:20.735 --> 45:22.805
- It is love. - Sure it is.

607
45:44.925 --> 45:45.925
Looking sharp.

608
45:46.495 --> 45:48.325
Um Tae Bong, here are your cue cards.

609
45:51.225 --> 45:54.135
Come on, even these are shaped like a car?

610
45:54.935 --> 45:57.305
Was this your idea too?

611
45:57.365 --> 46:00.375
You really like making things complicated, do you not?

612
46:00.875 --> 46:02.945
I will take that as a compliment on my thoroughness.

613
46:03.105 --> 46:04.345
Just read what is written on these cue cards...

614
46:04.345 --> 46:05.545
and you will be fine.

615
46:06.245 --> 46:07.475
That is up to me.

616
46:08.675 --> 46:09.685
By the way,

617
46:11.145 --> 46:12.715
where were you earlier?

618
46:13.215 --> 46:15.315
Disappearing right before the event.

619
46:15.655 --> 46:17.385
I was riding bikes with Hong Du.

620
46:20.425 --> 46:21.955
Is that so?

621
46:23.365 --> 46:26.365
Um Tae Bong, when you look at a woman,

622
46:26.735 --> 46:29.235
what do you see first? Her face?

623
46:29.805 --> 46:30.805
Or her heart?

624
46:33.035 --> 46:34.675
You seem like someone who does not know...

625
46:34.735 --> 46:35.745
how to look at either.

626
46:37.075 --> 46:39.945
- What does that... - Ladies and gentlemen,

627
46:40.445 --> 46:41.815
despite your busy schedules,

628
46:41.875 --> 46:45.015
we thank all our honored guests...

629
46:45.015 --> 46:46.715
for attending this party.

630
46:50.085 --> 46:52.455
You have waited a long time.

631
46:52.825 --> 46:55.255
Please understand that photography is not allowed...

632
46:55.355 --> 46:59.835
from this point forward, and now for today's highlight!

633
46:59.895 --> 47:04.765
The star of our charity auction, please welcome actor Um Tae Bong!

634
47:10.745 --> 47:12.945
- Oh my gosh. - So handsome.

635
47:15.715 --> 47:16.815
He is sexy.

636
47:19.055 --> 47:21.215
Hello, I am Um Tae Bong.

637
47:21.915 --> 47:26.055
The organizers prepared a greeting for me like this,

638
47:26.355 --> 47:27.495
but I am not the type...

639
47:27.555 --> 47:30.525
to stick to the script, even when filming a drama.

640
47:38.065 --> 47:41.075
- He is so cute. - I am standing here...

641
47:41.135 --> 47:44.675
as the new face of BK Motors, but as you all know,

642
47:44.845 --> 47:47.675
I am just a one-time model for six months.

643
47:47.815 --> 47:50.515
But using the excuse of a good cause,

644
47:50.585 --> 47:54.455
they are working me too hard, are they not?

645
48:00.355 --> 48:01.655
Wait a minute.

646
48:03.665 --> 48:07.265
At this very moment, my Instagram follower ranking is...

647
48:07.735 --> 48:11.505
Oh, my. I dropped again.

648
48:11.605 --> 48:12.735
I will try harder.

649
48:15.675 --> 48:18.475
So before I fall further behind someone else,

650
48:18.545 --> 48:20.945
I should quickly make this offer, right?

651
48:21.945 --> 48:22.945
Tonight,

652
48:23.885 --> 48:28.285
my time will be sold to you.

653
48:29.125 --> 48:30.125
Everyone.

654
48:30.655 --> 48:31.725
Please buy me.

655
48:37.725 --> 48:39.095
Yes, great.

656
48:39.365 --> 48:40.535
I will buy him!

657
48:40.595 --> 48:43.905
- I have to buy him! - All proceeds from this auction...

658
48:43.965 --> 48:45.775
will be donated to an international relief organization.

659
48:45.835 --> 48:47.805
Once again, this is...

660
48:47.875 --> 48:52.075
the dinner auction with Um Tae Bong. Now then!

661
48:52.145 --> 48:56.985
- We will start at 1,000 dollars! - I bid 1,000!

662
48:57.045 --> 48:58.645
The bid is 1,000 dollars. We have 1,000.

663
48:58.715 --> 49:00.585
- I bid 1,500. - Good. We have 1,500.

664
49:00.655 --> 49:02.755
- I bid 2,000. - Good. We have 2,000.

665
49:02.825 --> 49:04.385
- I bid 2,500. - Good. We have 2,500.

666
49:04.555 --> 49:06.655
- I bid 3,000. - Good. We have 3,000!

667
49:06.895 --> 49:07.955
Three thousand one hundred.

668
49:08.925 --> 49:10.565
- I bid 3,500. - I bid 4,000.

669
49:10.625 --> 49:12.835
We have 4,000. Yes. Any other bids?

670
49:12.895 --> 49:14.665
- I bid 5,000! - Good. We have 5,000.

671
49:14.735 --> 49:15.735
Six thousand!

672
49:15.805 --> 49:18.165
We have 6,000 there! Yes, 6,000.

673
49:18.235 --> 49:19.435
Look at those people.

674
49:20.005 --> 49:24.005
The master of romance is this scary. And then if they find something...

675
49:24.075 --> 49:25.075
that they do not like,

676
49:25.145 --> 49:26.715
they will tear him apart in an instant.

677
49:26.775 --> 49:29.915
We have 12,000. Good, 12,000. Now.

678
49:29.985 --> 49:31.545
- I bid 13,000. - The bid is 13,000!

679
49:31.615 --> 49:32.655
Is that Reporter Yeo Mi Ran?

680
49:33.055 --> 49:34.485
- I bid 15,000. - We have 15,000 over there!

681
49:34.555 --> 49:36.825
She is the one who writes the most articles about Tae Bong.

682
49:37.355 --> 49:39.925
- Was she invited too? - Oh, my.

683
49:40.395 --> 49:42.155
The price is not going up as much as I thought.

684
49:42.255 --> 49:43.925
I need to buy a building for my parents.

685
49:47.635 --> 49:49.805
Oh, my.

686
49:50.235 --> 49:51.935
Is my popularity only worth this much?

687
49:53.105 --> 49:56.805
- No. Not at all. - Then how about a kiss?

688
49:57.405 --> 49:59.645
- What? - What is she talking about?

689
50:01.175 --> 50:02.345
Who is that?

690
50:04.285 --> 50:06.515
I am sorry. My occupational hazard kicked in.

691
50:06.815 --> 50:08.655
I am Yeo Mi Ran, a reporter for Sports Daehan.

692
50:08.885 --> 50:09.885
A reporter...

693
50:09.955 --> 50:12.525
You know the Hollywood actress Charlize Theron, right?

694
50:13.055 --> 50:14.825
At a charity party, this actress...

695
50:15.625 --> 50:19.495
offered to kiss the person who donated the highest amount,

696
50:20.795 --> 50:22.295
and the bids skyrocketed immediately.

697
50:24.635 --> 50:25.975
How about our actor Um?

698
50:26.435 --> 50:30.175
Instead of a dinner, how about a kiss with Um Tae Bong?

699
50:33.915 --> 50:35.475
He does not do kisses.

700
50:37.145 --> 50:38.385
A kiss?

701
50:39.685 --> 50:41.355
It looks like Um Tae Bong is really caught in a trap.

702
50:41.415 --> 50:42.655
That is a good idea.

703
50:43.225 --> 50:45.925
Would he do something he has not even done in a drama?

704
50:46.425 --> 50:47.425
Look at the atmosphere.

705
50:48.755 --> 50:49.765
I told you earlier.

706
50:50.065 --> 50:51.395
He would be torn apart in an instant.

707
50:52.325 --> 50:55.095
He cannot keep the concept of not filming kiss scenes forever,

708
50:55.165 --> 50:57.265
so an unconventional move on a day like this...

709
50:57.535 --> 50:58.535
would not be so bad, right?

710
51:00.235 --> 51:02.605
- Today is fine. - Today is a good day for it.

711
51:02.675 --> 51:05.815
It is not like he actually cannot kiss.

712
51:06.515 --> 51:09.485
If so, that would mean he has been lying...

713
51:09.585 --> 51:11.315
and scamming the entire nation?

714
51:12.615 --> 51:13.985
If that is really the case,

715
51:14.715 --> 51:17.355
for a male actor who rose to fame through romance,

716
51:17.425 --> 51:19.255
that would be too fatal.

717
51:22.695 --> 51:23.925
No way.

718
51:24.295 --> 51:25.525
It is just a concept, right?

719
51:26.335 --> 51:27.765
Then has he been lying all this time?

720
51:28.665 --> 51:31.565
I tried it just once too.

721
51:33.475 --> 51:34.535
He cannot do it. Um Tae Bong.

722
51:36.605 --> 51:37.805
If he kisses,

723
51:40.745 --> 51:41.875
he will probably faint.

724
51:48.815 --> 51:51.185
Can you really not do it?

725
51:54.895 --> 51:56.925
I mean, if it is not that you have not done it...

726
51:57.025 --> 51:58.195
but that you cannot do it...

727
52:00.635 --> 52:02.335
Well, there is no way my speculative article...

728
52:02.395 --> 52:03.465
could be true.

729
52:04.135 --> 52:08.435
Gosh, everyone here must have gathered to see your face,

730
52:09.305 --> 52:11.675
so I thought a proposal like this would be possible.

731
52:11.875 --> 52:12.915
What should we do?

732
52:15.885 --> 52:17.445
What is this? What a buzzkill.

733
52:18.945 --> 52:21.415
Is it true? That would make it more fun.

734
52:21.855 --> 52:23.625
Um Tae Bong is in a tough spot.

735
52:28.455 --> 52:29.865
Should I tell you a secret too?

736
52:31.795 --> 52:33.965
There was a bag I wanted for a long time.

737
52:34.235 --> 52:36.105
But it was too expensive, so I could not buy it.

738
52:37.605 --> 52:39.475
I worked part-time jobs like crazy for months,

739
52:39.575 --> 52:40.875
and when I finally went to the store,

740
52:41.735 --> 52:44.105
they told me it had just been sold and they were wrapping it up.

741
52:46.215 --> 52:47.445
So you know what I did?

742
52:51.185 --> 52:54.815
I secretly scratched it with my fingernail.

743
52:58.485 --> 52:59.495
What is it?

744
53:02.725 --> 53:03.725
Nothing.

745
53:11.735 --> 53:12.735
I like it.

746
53:15.205 --> 53:16.445
Oh my.

747
53:16.505 --> 53:17.505
What?

748
53:18.945 --> 53:21.145
Whoever bids the highest today...

749
53:21.845 --> 53:26.585
will be the first person to publicly share a kiss with me.

750
53:26.855 --> 53:28.085
Is he serious?

751
53:32.855 --> 53:34.095
- Let's go. - Come on, let's go.

752
53:34.625 --> 53:35.625
Let's do this.

753
53:36.165 --> 53:37.695
- I bid 10,000. - Yes, we have 10,000.

754
53:37.765 --> 53:41.265
- Fifteen thousand. - Yes, 15,000 right away.

755
53:41.265 --> 53:42.265
Anyone else?

756
53:42.335 --> 53:44.405
- I bid 20,000. - The bid is 20,000.

757
53:44.665 --> 53:46.935
- I bid 25,000. - The bid is 25,000!

758
53:47.535 --> 53:50.375
- I bid 30,000. - Good. We have 30,000.

759
53:50.745 --> 53:52.945
- Anyone else still in? - Thirty-two thousand.

760
53:54.315 --> 53:55.515
- Three thousand five hundred! - Bids are climbing.

761
53:55.575 --> 53:57.145
- I bid 35,000! - I bid 40,000!

762
53:57.215 --> 54:01.785
Forty thousand! Wonderful. Anyone else? Yes.

763
54:02.755 --> 54:03.755
One hundred thousand dollars!

764
54:04.055 --> 54:05.185
- What? - Seriously?

765
54:06.555 --> 54:07.595
- Unbelievable. - Unbelievable.

766
54:09.625 --> 54:10.865
- My goodness. - Oh my.

767
54:11.895 --> 54:12.895
Unbelievable.

768
54:13.965 --> 54:16.635
I cannot reveal the source's identity,

769
54:16.635 --> 54:17.665
but it is solid.

770
54:17.765 --> 54:19.475
I think it is finally going to break tonight.

771
54:21.075 --> 54:22.105
Do not worry.

772
54:23.245 --> 54:26.415
I am going to throw out the bait later.

773
54:37.155 --> 54:38.155
Bait?

774
54:38.985 --> 54:39.995
Who is she talking about?

775
54:42.355 --> 54:43.425
Oh, Song Na Ri.

776
54:44.025 --> 54:45.125
Writer Pyo!

777
54:45.265 --> 54:48.535
But hey, you came to keep an eye on Um Tae Bong, did you not?

778
54:49.835 --> 54:50.835
No...

779
54:51.335 --> 54:52.905
- One hundred thousand dollars? - I am here to protect him.

780
54:54.705 --> 54:55.875
One hundred thousand dollars.

781
54:56.305 --> 54:58.375
Is 100,000 dollars for real?

782
54:58.745 --> 54:59.845
That is right. The bid is 100,000 dollars.

783
55:02.215 --> 55:04.345
This is no joke. Yes.

784
55:07.855 --> 55:09.985
As expected, a girlfriend who says,

785
55:09.985 --> 55:11.985
"I protect my boyfriend's lips." Something like that, right?

786
55:12.125 --> 55:14.425
Anyway, Song Na Ri has just bid...

787
55:14.855 --> 55:17.525
100,000 dollars.

788
55:18.525 --> 55:20.765
As soon as the party ends, the winning bid...

789
55:20.835 --> 55:21.865
must be paid immediately.

790
55:21.935 --> 55:23.465
You are aware of that, right, Song Na Ri?

791
55:23.535 --> 55:24.535
Yes.

792
55:24.605 --> 55:27.935
Well then, I will bid 200,000 dollars!

793
55:28.935 --> 55:30.845
Oh no. She is out of her mind.

794
55:31.375 --> 55:33.715
- Two hundred thousand dollars? - Oh my...

795
55:35.045 --> 55:37.485
Will you back down for 200,000 dollars?

796
55:37.845 --> 55:38.845
Will you?

797
55:42.285 --> 55:43.285
Two hundred thousand dollars.

798
55:44.625 --> 55:45.625
Two hundred thousand dollars.

799
55:53.465 --> 55:54.665
What are you doing here?

800
55:55.295 --> 55:56.365
Well...

801
55:56.865 --> 55:58.935
Chairman Oh, you are here?

802
55:59.535 --> 56:00.575
Good work.

803
56:03.945 --> 56:05.505
What about the charity donation auction?

804
56:05.775 --> 56:07.515
It is actually the highlight right now.

805
56:09.345 --> 56:11.145
Surely no one will offer 300,000 dollars...

806
56:11.215 --> 56:13.655
at this point, right?

807
56:13.955 --> 56:17.285
What do I do? I am so embarrassed.

808
56:17.555 --> 56:22.525
Now, to Madam Number 22 who offered 200,000 dollars,

809
56:22.555 --> 56:24.965
a kiss with Um Tae Bong...

810
56:27.195 --> 56:28.195
Three hundred thousand dollars.

811
56:28.665 --> 56:30.335
- What? - Really?

812
56:32.365 --> 56:33.405
Three hundred thousand dollars!

813
56:34.335 --> 56:37.175
Is it really 300,000 dollars?

814
56:38.445 --> 56:40.675
- It is 300,000 dollars. - It really is 300,000 dollars.

815
56:40.975 --> 56:43.015
Madam Number 22 has also given up.

816
56:43.445 --> 56:46.045
- Is there anyone else? - If it is 300,000 dollars...

817
56:46.385 --> 56:47.955
- Is it 300,000 dollars? - It is 300,000 dollars...

818
56:48.015 --> 56:52.685
Yes, then the opportunity to share a kiss with Um Tae Bong...

819
56:53.895 --> 56:59.425
has been awarded to that person right there!

820
57:01.295 --> 57:04.535
Now, our generous 300,000 dollars donor,

821
57:04.765 --> 57:07.035
would you please come to the front?

822
58:15.475 --> 58:16.475
Is that the person?

823
58:16.545 --> 58:19.375
Yes. The donation is a whopping 300,000 dollars.

824
58:22.175 --> 58:24.545
Darn it, what do we do about Tae Bong?

825
58:26.885 --> 58:29.655
The prize changed from a meal to a kiss with Tae Bong.

826
58:29.925 --> 58:31.725
I heard everything, you punk. Hang up.

827
58:32.895 --> 58:35.695
Why did he have to say he would do a charity event?

828
58:40.465 --> 58:42.065
Why is that person here?

829
58:42.905 --> 58:44.665
Chairman Oh, you are here?

830
58:44.735 --> 58:46.435
- Yes. Good work. - Chairman Oh?

831
58:47.475 --> 58:49.875
- Chairman of BK? - The charity donation auction is...

832
58:49.975 --> 58:50.975
Could it be...

833
58:54.775 --> 58:56.215
- "I protect my boyfriend's lips." - Hong Du.

834
58:56.285 --> 58:58.915
Something like that, right?

835
58:58.985 --> 59:01.815
- Anyway, Song Na Ri has just bid... - Anyway...

836
59:01.885 --> 59:04.655
- 100,000 dollars. - Hong Du's father...

837
59:04.725 --> 59:06.555
I was just going to watch and leave...

838
59:06.625 --> 59:07.795
what should we do about Um Tae Bong?

839
59:08.595 --> 59:10.965
Hong Du, did you know too?

840
59:12.125 --> 59:13.195
I see.

841
59:14.335 --> 59:15.535
What do we do?

842
59:15.695 --> 59:17.735
Is the era of Um Tae Bong as the romance master...

843
59:17.805 --> 59:20.005
- coming to an end now? - The bid is 200,000 dollars!

844
59:24.245 --> 59:25.245
Maybe...

845
59:26.245 --> 59:27.715
there might be a way.

846
59:29.515 --> 59:30.615
Is there a way?

847
59:31.745 --> 59:33.385
- No way... - Maybe.

848
59:34.015 --> 59:36.055
Surely no one will offer 300,000 dollars...

849
59:36.055 --> 59:38.525
- at this point, right? - Hong Du,

850
59:38.925 --> 59:42.225
I will bet Tae Bong's and my future...

851
59:42.855 --> 59:43.865
(Blank Check)

852
59:43.925 --> 59:45.195
on you.

853
59:45.625 --> 59:47.935
A kiss with Um Tae Bong...

854
01:00:17.265 --> 01:00:18.265
Young lady.

855
01:00:20.135 --> 01:00:21.135
Hae Ra?

856
01:00:26.605 --> 01:00:27.605
You?

857
01:00:29.745 --> 01:00:31.475
Blue suits me better.

858
01:00:32.475 --> 01:00:35.275
What, you think I prepared this?

859
01:00:36.785 --> 01:00:38.915
- I did not. - Who said you did?

860
01:00:39.755 --> 01:00:41.415
Still acting tough even now.

861
01:00:46.355 --> 01:00:49.255
It is all over now. In front of these people...

862
01:00:50.665 --> 01:00:51.925
- I clearly... - No.

863
01:01:01.135 --> 01:01:02.575
Hello, Hero.

864
01:01:10.845 --> 01:01:12.315
I wanted to be a hero.

865
01:01:17.185 --> 01:01:20.795
Trust me. I am that kiddo right now.

866
01:01:23.465 --> 01:01:24.465
What?

867
01:01:25.295 --> 01:01:28.195
And this is...

868
01:01:28.995 --> 01:01:31.935
not comfort, but treatment.

869
01:02:00.095 --> 01:02:02.265
(Oh! My Guard)
